<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Title</title>
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover"
    />
    <link href="./{{style}}.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link type="text/css" href="../../styles/public.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="../../js/tailwindcss-3.1.8.js"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="text-neutral-600">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] py-8">
      <div class="header p-6 flex mb-8 rounded-xl bg-cover justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <h1 class="text-4xl italic name mb-2 px-2">
            {{ info.nickname }}
            <span class="text-lg">lv.{{ info.level }}</span>
          </h1>
          <h1 class="italic uid px-10">UID - {{ uid }}</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="box pt-4 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
        <div>
          <h2 class="box-title text-center text-xl ring text-neutral-100 p-1">
            数据总览
          </h2>
          <div class="p-6 grid grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-center">
            {% for label, key in stats_labels %}
            <div class="">
              <div class="text-xl box-stats">{{ stats[key] }}</div>
              <div class="text-neutral-400 box-stats-label">{{ label }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="box-title text-center text-xl ring text-neutral-100 p-1">
            地区建设
          </h2>
          <div class="p-6 grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center text-neutral-100">
            {% for e in explorations %}
                {% if e.domainId not in skip_explor %}
                    <div class="w-full flex flex-col items-center p-2 space-y-1 relative">
                        <div class="absolute w-full h-full z-10"
                             style="background: #67504B; border-radius: 8px;"
                        >
                            <img src="./icon/{{ e.domainId }}.jpg" alt="" class="absolute w-full h-full z-20" style="border-radius: 8px; filter: brightness(0.4);">
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg p-2 space-y-1 z-30 min-h-[160px]">
                            <div class="text-sm w-full truncate">
                                <span class="truncate">{{ e.name }}</span>
                                <span>Lv.{{ e.level }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div style="height: 20px;"></div>
                            {% if e.settlements %}
                                <div class="w-full space-y-1">
                                    {% for settlement in e.settlements %}
                                        <div class="w-full flex justify-between text-xs px-1">
                                            <span class="truncate">{{ settlement.name }}</span>
                                            <span>Lv.{{ settlement.level }}</span>
                                        </div>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about text-center leading-8 text-xs opacity-50">
          所有数据会有一小时延迟 以游戏内为准 此处仅供参考
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
